{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-07_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-07","title":"抵近支援作战","storyCode":"14-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9b3a9a775e68f759f9a8c34fa63d01166a937143f5926140f534269fb2b97ed4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g2_mainbattlefield"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g2_mainbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天上飞的那都是......什么啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卧倒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，你的左手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是普通的炮。萨卡兹的巫术......带有腐蚀性。我有些使不上力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陷进污染区的那些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都没救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这天上飞的，地里长的，再加上到处都是结晶和粉尘，连走一步都难！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹要的，就是把战场变成他们最熟悉的样子，再把我们都逼下载具，堵住了蒙头打一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真论步兵硬碰硬，弹药将尽的情况下，萨卡兹的身体素质一定占优。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，我懂了，净耍阴招！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们一定不能被打蒙。这第一下蒙了，那就立刻全完蛋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，尽量让我们的车能动的都动起来，避免和萨卡兹步兵短兵相接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算车坏了，也别轻易放弃车上的炮，那是我们最高效的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，通信兵尽量铺开。至少要保证典范军内部还能相互联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要往前走的话，我们得拿下前面的移动祭坛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角小姐，我需要炮手掩护！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因陀罗小队负责牵制敌方的——不管那是术师还是法术造物——就天上飞的那些东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达小队跟着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到核心了——行动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一座萨卡兹的巫术祭坛。\n攀登，借力，跃起，挥锤。\n随着战争的持续进行，她们开始对这些恶魔眼睛一样的战争器械越来越熟悉了。\n她们对战争本身也越来越熟悉。\n维娜时常感到因陀罗、摩根和达格达有些变了。她相信同样的变化也能在自己身上看见。\n这变化是好的吗？又或者，她们的变化还是来得太迟了？\n赤红的恶魔之眼凝视着她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锤子重重地落下，在推进之王落到地面上之前，祭坛开始坍塌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，比上次还要快一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那玩意儿......长出来了！又一座祭坛，就离我们干倒的那东西不远！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这地里到底埋着多少这种要命的东西？真的是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没完没了。\n推进之王握紧了锤子。\n她们的确在适应。但还是不够快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“灰礼帽”，剑座的位置有变化吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并未收到计划变更的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到处都是这么夸张的源石晶簇，船还能动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚拥有最强大的陆上舰队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许行进的速度会受到影响，但我们还不至于束手无策。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......舰炮声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听声音，是铁公爵的“加斯特里尔”号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的新一轮进攻开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g4_warshipandswrdpedestal"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚伯科恩的一艘突击舰撞上了萨卡兹的先遣大队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人躲在迷雾里，突然就冒了出来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的视野被源石晶簇遮挡得厉害，根本捕捉不到他们的动向！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中距离通讯恢复了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舰载通讯塔依旧失灵。工程队正在尝试修复，但这样的源石环境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......公爵阁下，您怎么到甲板上来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面到处都是源石粉尘，您还是尽量不要离开指挥室......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，威灵顿一直都会站在“加斯特里尔”号的甲板上，亲自指挥他的前线部队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铁公爵身经百战，您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚，“加斯特里尔”号开炮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您没听错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还在前进？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是的。铁公爵的队伍突进得比我们想象的更深，应该很快就要撞上萨卡兹的中心部队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铁公爵难道是想斩首那个萨卡兹的君主？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我认识的维斯利·威灵顿，在成为铁公爵之前，的确是一名战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的勇敢或许沾着点疯狂......但他从不会拿战局当赌注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，铁公爵的冒进为我们带来了很大的风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照最初的指令，亚伯科恩公爵和阿什沃思公爵的队伍正跟着铁公爵前行......我们的前锋部队也在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上源石地形阻碍，我们的阵线正在被拉长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放在“加斯特里尔”号上的“眼睛”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都看不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是我们“灰礼帽”之间的通讯......也大幅度延迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾琳，确认剑座状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前没有问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们绝不会让萨卡兹的巫术污染剑座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下，“诗人”发射了信号弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，亚历山德莉娜和诸王之息快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让你的人跟紧些。别让剑在战场上迷了路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须让诸王之息马上发挥作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非完全恢复通讯......否则所谓的公爵联军，并不能真正成立。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g2_mainbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人似乎在变强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同一种巫术......侵蚀我们，增强他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锤子落下，食腐者战士的身躯塌陷了一块。\n但他依然在前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二锤，第三锤。\n达格达跳了回来，钢爪劈开腰腹。\n“灰礼帽”的焰刃刺穿胸膛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉闷的喘息）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才一个。前面还有......那么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些萨卡兹真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族佬都是怪物，该死，根本不是活着的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是只有死人......死人才能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奇异的响动自四周传来。\n不同于源石晶簇刺破地面的声响，也并非结晶粉尘炸开的前兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，再这样下去不是办法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人——越杀越多！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就盯着眼前的这一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总会有人走到最前面的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"架盾，开炮。重复了无数遍的动作。\n维多利亚拥有大地上最强的武器。一枚炮弹，能轻松炸开一个萨卡兹的甲胄。\n然而很快，两个萨卡兹同时冲过来。之后是三个。\n炮火竭尽全力地倾泻着，却挡不住汹涌而来的浪潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无穷无尽的敌人。\n她几乎看不清到底面前有多少萨卡兹，站着的，躺着的。\n死去的维多利亚人，说不定更多。\n她能听见风笛的呼喊，破城矛依旧在动。这是最大的安慰，足以支撑她继续战斗下去。\n一抹火光突然在不远处跳了跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，队长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像......又看到了希尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗯，希尔。\n还是那张脸。那张时不时出现在她的噩梦中，提醒她队友是如何惨死的......属于叛徒的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个......躺着的人？他好像战死了有一段时间了......呃，队长，他刚刚是不是......是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他正在......站起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“副官希尔”","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"穿着威灵顿部队制服的男人，摇摇晃晃地朝他们走过来。\n他举起握着的刀，劈向号角面前的一个萨卡兹。\n甲胄太厚，反过来震开了他的手。他的胳膊奇怪地扭曲着，又劈了第二次，第三次。\n那张熟悉的面孔距离她们越来越近——\n一片死寂的灰白之中，只有一点紫色正在跃动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是——深池！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g3_mainbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我放下战士的荣誉，只为以后塔拉的土地不必再被鲜血浸泡，德拉克的同族不必再刀剑相向。”\n“除非有朝一日，红龙的火焰能令死去的战士从熔炉中复生。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三组祭坛，破坏完毕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，术师和飞行兵都已就位。我们正接近最大的祭坛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说死去的同胞替我们抵挡了魔族佬的污染......但此处巫术的杀伤力空前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要......亲自前去破坏祭坛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为臣子的你们，已经尽力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为君主的我，理应带领你们前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若我没有亲自踏上这片土地，又如何将它变成我的国度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红龙的火......会像过去千万年一样，落在战争的最前线。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——祭坛正在遭到破坏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维持阵型！不要被火冲散——继续施术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过又是一些软弱的异族人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可别这样说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们和活在蜜里的维多利亚人，可完全不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一个塔拉战士，都曾在阴影里蛰伏，被痛苦千锤百炼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们曾以鬼魂为名，最熟悉与死亡为伍的滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能让你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想以自己为施法材料......引爆祭坛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......来不及......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"生命的火正在渐渐暗淡。\n取而代之的，是紫色的死火，同时跃动在垂死的萨卡兹战士身上，还有爱布拉娜的眼睛里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有什么主宰死亡的王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹，你们熟悉死亡，不过是因为......经历的战争足够多而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都看见了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡是站在我们这边的！我们不是在和一群看不清模样的魔鬼交战！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把萨卡兹从装模作样的法阵里揪出来，让他们尝一尝我们的弩和炮的滋味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“校官”......你的眼睛里，有火在烧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，还有无数塔拉出身的将士，都已经等了太久太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们谁不是听着帝国丧钟的传奇长大，带着一腔热血从军的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可过去几十年，威灵顿领和公爵阁下被死死钳制着，我们也一样被夹在其他公爵的谈判桌的缝隙中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么多满怀热血的战士，要么因出身而被打压，要么憋屈地死在维多利亚人的阴谋诡计里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忍耐这么多年，甚至放任自己也成了耍弄心计的小人，就是为了一场真正的战争，一场并不是由贵族私利点燃的战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有在这样的战场上，战士的死才是光荣的，才是有意义的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我在这场战斗中死去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请务必用您的火，让我重新站起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在烈火焚尽我的残躯之前，在我们理想的国度得以建立之前——我绝不放下武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，那就随我上前去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到......那枯木王座了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是萨卡兹的头领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者孽茨雷，他自称战争与死亡的王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹王庭很喜欢这类夸大的称谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夸大？......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是足够古老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但活着的传说，不是只有他一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当然！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不远处，舰炮轰鸣。\n能让山峦崩裂的力量，自然从不独属于古老的巫术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就让战争对战争......死亡对死亡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g3_mainbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗长，围猎被打断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那条德拉克的火，截断了我们的阵型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德拉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数千年前，刚刚失去家园的萨卡兹，也曾在这片土地上与红龙交战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成千上万的萨卡兹在火焰下化作焦黑的石头。它们此刻就在我们脚下，我们身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们去杀死她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一条红龙，够我们饱腹一阵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正驱使着这场战争的，并不是她。"},{"type":"narration","text":"食腐者之王将目光投向战场的某一处。\n在那红龙带来的火与烟之后，有一个庞大的影子正以与身形不符的速度冲向他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将阴影投于大地，一吐息就能使得山河震颤的巨物——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早已不再是红龙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g13_warshipcommandroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"“参数设定完毕！”\n“装填完毕！”\n“干扰弹发射！”\n“锁定目标——”\n“主舰炮，第一轮齐射！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确认击碎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高级军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，路障已清理完毕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“加斯特里尔”号，全速前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目标——食腐者的王座。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g2_mainbattlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"舰炮轰鸣。\n威灵顿熟悉他最忠诚的老部下——船上最老的一门舰炮，曾随他一同轰开过林贡斯的大门。\n他杀死了那座大地上最强盛的移动城市。他将它的脊骨从尸身上抽出来，做成了军舰的一部分。\n之后他又和“加斯特里尔”号一起，去过许多地方，战胜了很多敌人。\n莱塔尼亚术师的法术球，乌萨斯先锋的盾，萨尔贡刺客的黄金刃——他将所有敌人身上最有价值的部分收集并改装，放在这艘旗舰上。\n并非为了纪念。只有随着岁月变得软弱的人，才需要通过这些往日的痕迹缅怀过去。\n“加斯特里尔”号必须踏过敌人的骸骨，吸纳它们的力量，从而变得更强壮。\n只有这样，他们才能一同战胜更强大的敌人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g3_mainbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦截！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晶簇屏障......已碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人仍在前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用炮火开道，渴求被赐予死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一波又一波的炮击，倾泻在源石海面上。\n金色的碎末崩解四散，凝结的巨浪出现缺口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它竟敢......如此靠近——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"浓雾漫上战舰。\n无数食腐者战士落到甲板上，巫术的光笼罩整艘船。\n撕咬，拆解，腐蚀。\n炮火沉寂了下去。\n就像之前所有陷入食腐者法术阵地的猎物一样，坚硬的钢铁之躯正在被消化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捕获......完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没有。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他举起法杖。\n枝条自王座之下极速生长，挡在食腐者战士阵前。\n一枚炮弹嵌在枝条之间。\n数秒后，炮弹炸开，枝条尽数断裂。\n开战之后第一次，食腐者的王座摇晃了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗长！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"腐败的浓雾之中，渐渐露出了舰船的影子。\n外层的部分已在腐败的侵蚀下剥落，主副舰炮也在巫术飞弹的轰击下损伤近半，唯有一副钢铁骨架，仍在闪烁光芒。\n她依旧是“加斯特里尔”号，陆地上最强大的军舰。\n而她的主人——\n王座上的萨卡兹低下头，于晶簇之间找到了一个小小的影子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g2_mainbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤铁近卫队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，萨卡兹的前锋主力的确被“加斯特里尔”号吸引！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤铁近卫队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不知道我们已经从主舰上转移——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤铁近卫队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，有东西正在飞速靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤铁近卫队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"护卫队，收缩阵型！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一轮炮击。\n只有几缕细小的枝条随烟尘落下。\n足以让结晶浪潮碎裂的力量，未能撼动半空中的身影分毫。\n食腐者之王俯视军阵中央的指挥官，苍老的菲林背后的不远处，那艘渴血的军舰正等待着撕扯腐烂的血肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的......公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们吞吃了许多维多利亚人。将军，伯爵，无论什么头衔，大多都是一个味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阴谋家，商人，而不是战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们以为战场是桌子上的沙盘，战士是一枚枚棋子，战争是争权夺利的工具。他们如此地轻视战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，不太一样。你的船同样吃掉过许多敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯人，莱塔尼亚人，高卢人......萨卡兹。我能闻到他们血肉的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们也曾被食腐者吸纳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......我曾读过无数关于你的记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古老的食腐者，以维多利亚军队十分之一的兵力，将其阻拦于卡兹戴尔之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可思议，无法被军事学院教授，也不可能被复制的战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为寻仇而来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。我只遗憾，两百年前，我并未出生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们叫你“战争之神”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。战争不可能有什么绝对的主宰者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有......当下的胜负。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"威灵顿拔出了自己的佩剑，笔直地指向半空中的萨卡兹。\n在他身后，所有的舰炮都调转到了同一个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孽茨雷，我会战胜你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威灵顿公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就如我战胜那些早已死去的强敌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
